#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0581 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: None of TRTP, TRTPGy, TRTA, and TRTAGy are present and none of the character treatment variables in ADSL defined in the IG are present
#note "Only TRT01P is present (no TRTP, no TRTA) -> TRTxxP is present for xx=01, no violation. ADaMIG numbers xx from 01, so a dataset carrying any TRTxxP carries TRT01P."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TRT01P type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | Placebo
